{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X 的大块直接交代人物处境、原因和心理转折，全曲从离开、怀念、犹豫到不再为留住谁而忍让，主线清楚；Y 只看加亮短语时，部分屏的因果关系需要依赖小字补足。small、concise、fine：X 的感受小字更集中地补充人物当下的具体体验，如 S07 的后颈发凉、脉搏乱跳，S05 的脚下落空、争累后的长叹；Y 虽然补充得更丰富，但有些感受与话重复，或转向音乐本身的描写，整体显得繁复。human：判平，X 有「要还得一个人顶着」「那样的日子毕竟真切过过」等不够自然的表达；Y 也有「要还是只能一个人顶着」「眷恋里仍带着失落」等搭配或书面表达，整体没有明显胜负。load：Y 更好，虽然加亮短语数量较多，但每块短得多；X 在 S11、S12 等短停留屏上，完整的大字句子明显更难扫完。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0bf61e8e-f166-45fd-b4a9-c2984cd74875", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T235403170928Z", "elapsed_seconds": 354.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T23:59:58.074468+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6cf93115fab63292d0313581224591e9a571613f81a1cb7d47137a29d9c29319", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb5